rma.it/en/the-theatre/who-we-are/">Who we are</a></li><li id="menu-item-2999" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2999"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/the-theatre/allestimenti/">Allestimenti</a></li><li id="menu-item-2997" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2997"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/the-theatre/contact-us/">Contact us</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-3108" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-3108"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/training/">Training</a><ul class="sub-menu"><li id="menu-item-3109" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3109"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/training/accademia-verdiana-en/accademia-verdiana-2026/">Accademia Verdiana 2026</a></li><li id="menu-item-5566" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-5566"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/training/accademia-verdiana-en/accademia-verdiana-2025/">Accademia Verdiana 2025</a></li><li id="menu-item-5559" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-5559"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/training/scuola-di-alta-sartoria/scuola-di-alta-sartoria-2026/">Accademia di Sartoria V edizione</a></li><li id="menu-item-5581" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-5581"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/training/laboratorio-vocale-da-camera/laboratorio-vocale-da-camera-2026/">Laboratorio vocale da camera 2026</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-3114" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-3114"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/archive/">Archive</a><ul class="sub-menu"><li id="menu-item-3919" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3919"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/archive/performances-archive/">Performances archive</a></li><li id="menu-item-3918" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3918"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/archive/archivio-formazione/">Training archive</a></li><li id="menu-item-5549" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-5549"><a href="https://old.teatroregioparma.it/en/homepage/">Past performances archive</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-3128" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children menu-item-3128"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/support-us/">Support us</a><ul class="sub-menu"><li id="menu-item-3208" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3208"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/support-us/sponsors-and-supporters/">Sponsors and supporters</a></li><li id="menu-item-3508" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3508"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/support-us/diventa-sponsor/">Become a sponsor</a></li><li id="menu-item-3534" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3534"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/support-us/art-bonus/">Art Bonus</a></li><li id="menu-item-4463" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4463"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/support-us/5x1000/">5&#215;1000</a></li><li id="menu-item-3493" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3493"><a href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/support-us/international-friends-of-festival-verdi/">International Friends of Festival Verdi</a></li></ul></li></ul></div></div>
<button class="menu-toggle" aria-controls="menu-main" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle menu"></button></div></header><main id="primary" class="site-main alignfull wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained"><div class="page-header alignfull is-layout-constrained with-image with-video has-dark-gray-background-color has-base-color bkg-image-type" data-text-color="base" style="background-color: #707070; --background-overlay:0.21; --background-image: url('https://teatroregioparma.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Teatro-Regio-di-Parma__ph-Roberto-Ricci-scaled.jpg')"><div class="alignwide content"><div class="breadcrumb">Visit us</div><div class="flex text"><h1>Guided <br />
tours</h1></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9b72719b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66%"><h2 id="guided-tours" class="wp-block-heading">guided tours</h2><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9b72719b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">You can discover the Teatro Regio and its history by taking a guided tour of the Foyer, the Main Auditorium and the Ridotto, available in Italian and English and lasting approximately 30 minutes. Groups are advised to book in advance. The tour route is fully accessible.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">When rehearsals or performances are taking place, some areas may not be accessible and guided tours may be suspended; we therefore invite you to contact us to check availability.</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-bf881693 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://teatroregioparma.it/en/visit-us/tours-and-special-visits/">discover tours and special visits</a></div></div></div></div><h2 id="timetables" class="wp-block-heading">Timetables</h2><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9b72719b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Tuesday &#8211; Saturday</strong> h. 9.30* – 12.30 and 14.30*  &#8211; 17.00 <br><strong>Sundays</strong> h. 10.00 &#8211; 16.00</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Duration 30 minutes</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">*For groups and school groups, in addition to the standard visiting hours, slots at 9.30 am and 2.30 pm are reserved from Tuesday to Saturday.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Opening hours</strong><br>Monday December 7 2026 open from 9:30 a.m. to 12:30 p.m. and from 2:30 p.m. to 5:00 p.m.<br>Thursday December 31 2026 open from 9:30 a.m. to 1:00 p.m.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Closing hours</strong><br>Tuesday December 8 2026<br>Friday December 11 2026<br>Thursday December 24 2026<br>Friday December 25 2026<br>Saturday December 26 2026<br>Friday January 1 2027<br>Wednesday January 6 2027<br>Wednesday January 13 2027</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><br></p></div></div><h2 id="getting-here" class="wp-block-heading">GETTING HERE</h2><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9b72719b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Fondazione Teatro Regio di Parma</strong> <br>strada Garibaldi, 16/a <br>43121 Parma – Italia</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-bf881693 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/dSSWSb67ALQit1UX7">GET DIRECTIONS</a></div></div></div></div><h2 id="prices" class="wp-block-heading">PrICES</h2><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9b72719b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Full price</strong>: €12.00<br><strong>Discount price</strong>:<strong> </strong>€8.00 (under 25, over 65, groups of more than 20 people, visitors to the Casa della Musica and the Arturo Toscanini House)<br><strong>Discount price</strong>: €3.00 (under 18)</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Free admission</strong>: for people with disabilities and their accompanying persons, tour guides and children under 6.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Visiting times are subject to change in the event of performances or rehearsals.</em></p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"></div></div><h2 id="bookshop" class="wp-block-heading">Bookshop</h2><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9b72719b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">At the bookshop, located at the theatre entrance and run by the Azzali family – the city’s long-established publishers – you can buy a unique item as a gift for someone else or for yourself.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">You’ll find the Regio’s new merchandise collections, all the theatre’s publications, librettos, CDs, DVDs, music-related items, posters and playbills for operas and shows, postcards, magnets and a wide range of souvenirs, so you can take home a unique memento of the theatre and Parma.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>The bookshop will maintain the same opening and closing days and the same times for guided tours.</em></p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9b72719b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 id="suggested-itineraries" class="wp-block-heading">SUGGESTED ITINERARIES</h2></div></div><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9b72719b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Recommended places and monuments to help you continue exploring the history of the city of Parma and the lives of the figures who have contributed to Parma’s great musical tradition:</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Museo Glauco Lombardi</strong><br>For a charming journey in the footsteps of Duchess Marie Louise. <a href="https://www.museolombardi.it" type="link" id="www.museolombardi.it">www.museolombardi.it</a></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Casa natale Arturo Toscanini</strong><br>To learn more about the life and career of the renowned maestro Arturo Toscanini. <a href="https://www.museotoscanini.it" type="link" id="www.museotoscanini.it">www.museotoscanini.it</a></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>La Casa della Musica</strong><br>Housed within the Renaissance Palazzo Cusani, La Casa della Musica is home to the Museo dell&#8217;Opera and other spaces waiting to be explored.<br><a href="https://www.lacasadellamusica.it/it-IT/homepage-casa-della-musica.aspx">www.lacasadellamusica.it</a></p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-column spacer is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:8%"></div><div class="wp-block-column sticky is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:25%"><div class="anchor-menu side-auto-type alignfull is-layout-constrained"><div class="alignwide"><div class="anchors">
